{
  "comment": [
    "Pinned third-party sources for the Windows (Kainote.sln) build.",
    "These are plain upstream releases carrying no Kainote changes, so they are",
    "fetched at build time instead of being committed. Run Thirdparty/hydrate.ps1",
    "before opening Kainote.sln for the first time, or after bumping a version here.",
    "",
    "The MSVC project that compiles each of these lives in Thirdparty/Build/<Name>/",
    "and IS tracked, because the project files are Kainote's own work.",
    "",
    "The Linux build (CMakeLists.txt) ignores this file entirely; it resolves every",
    "one of these through pkg-config against the distribution's packages.",
    "",
    "To bump a dependency: change version+url, then put the new archive's SHA-256",
    "in sha256 (PowerShell: Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 <file>). hydrate.ps1",
    "refuses to extract an archive whose hash does not match."
  ],
